From: Rolando Trevino <122947376+rolotrealanis98@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 28 Nov 2026 03:17:27 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 9/9] settings: slim profile (BB_SLIM)

flutter build linux --dart-define=BB_SLIM=true hides the options a single desktop
owner does not need (about 45 tiles and 7 top-level entries, matched by title in
SettingsTile, SettingsSwitch and SettingsOptions) and seeds Messages-like defaults
for keys never saved (delivery status and timestamps, unknown-sender filter,
Mark Read as the only notification action, full image quality, emoticons).
Nothing is removed from the app and nothing the owner saved is overwritten; no
account, server or Private API sending option is touched. A normal build is
unchanged: the flag is a compile-time constant.
